<title>AUSTRALIA: Data backs Australia economic growth pick up-govt.</title>
<headline>Data backs Australia economic growth pick up-govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Assistant Treasurer Rod Kemp said on Tuesday that recent economic data supported the government's view that economic growth would pick up over calendar 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm pleased to report that recent economic developments support that view,&quot; Kemp told parliament.</p>
</text>
